about:
  heading: "The Arthur Hill Estate Sale"
  paragraphs:
    - "Hidden up at the tippy top of the southwest hills is a Portland classic overlooking the suburbs. The Arthur Hill Estate belonged to a former doctor whom specialized in pediatrics and a collector of antique medical devices and glass bottles, including a museums worth collection of historical baby feeder vessels. The home has been owned by the same family for decades and is full of great quality furniture, art glass, Persian rugs, and plenty more homestyle goods. A collection of antique flow blue china in pristine condition. A room full of vintage clothing, shoes, and accessories, plus costume jewelry. A variety of miniature cat figurines. Skiing equipment. Vinyl records and CDs. Plenty of books and encyclopedias. Workshop of tools. A wall of vintage keys. Sewing machines and charming spool storage drawers. There is just so much vintage treasures that have been hiding in this charming and homely estate. Featured Artists: Harry Widman, Sally Haley, Michele Russo, Fay Jones, Jack Portland, Gregory Grennon"
